cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "All of Us Long Read Project: Phase 1 code"
abstract: >-
  WDL workflows, Jupyter notebooks, and analysis scripts for Phase 1 of the All of Us
  Long Read Project (AoU-LR): per-sample processing of PacBio HiFi data, structural
  variant filtering and cohort merging, reference panel construction, short-read
  genotyping and imputation, and downstream analyses. This code accompanies the
  manuscript "Population-scale long-read sequencing in an All of Us cohort selected
  from self-identified Black or African American participants".
type: software
version: v1.0.0
date-released: "2026-09-25"
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.22952705
license: BSD-3-Clause
repository-code: "https://github.com/all-of-us/long-reads-public-codebase"
keywords:
  - All of Us
  - long-read sequencing
  - structural variants
  - reference panel
  - imputation
  - WDL
